= SKD Publish =

"""Marks what this hip publishes."""

Wire it below the last node of the work to publish. Publish, here or on the shelf, writes the next version, makes it current and tells the departments downstream.

Layers above a Layer Break are left out. Everything else is flattened into one file.

A hip holds one publish node.

@inputs

Input Stage:
    The stage to publish.

@parameters

Publish:
    #id: publish
    Opens the publish dialog.
